Subject: [PATCH 45/68] feat(03.1-02): register pc_scan and gmail_scan MCP
 tools in brain server

- Add pc_scan tool: runs PC digital fingerprint scan, returns insights
- Add gmail_scan tool: scans Gmail inbox with configurable days_back/max_emails
- Both handlers log events to brain.events with source='onboarding'
- Gmail scan returns graceful error message when OAuth not configured
- Tool count updated: 10 -> 12

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
